{"case_id": "male_19710412_P005-Q25", "domain": "health", "question": "命主在哪一年意外受伤大腿骨折？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": null, "raw_answer": "根据命主八字辛亥、壬辰、丁卯、戊申，日主丁火生于辰月，得印星卯木生扶，时柱伤官生财。原局地支卯申暗合，有金木相战之象，申金为骨骼，卯木为四肢，卯申合已埋下外伤隐患。当流年冲克申金或卯木时，易引发骨折。\n\n看大运：阴年男命顺行，起运约8岁。1998年27岁在甲午运，2010年39岁在丙申运，2018年47岁在丙申运，2022年51岁在丁酉运。骨折为突发意外，需引动金木冲战。1998戊寅年，太岁寅木冲申，但大运甲午，寅午半合火局，合而解冲，冲力减弱。2018戊戌年，卯戌合火，无直接冲克，不主骨折。2022壬寅年，太岁寅冲申，大运丁酉，酉冲日支卯，有受伤之象，但天干丁壬合，冲克稍缓。\n\n2010庚寅年，大运丙申，流年天干庚金与大运丙火相克，地支太岁寅木与大运申金、时柱申金构成双申冲一寅，金木剧烈冲战，且大运与命宫重叠在申，太岁直冲命宫。申金旺冲寅木，金为骨，寅为肢体，正应大腿骨折意外。因此，2010年最为符合。最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": false, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "parser_invalid", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b2b", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_19710412_P005-Q25", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "invalid", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b2b_R1_P0_G3\\details_2024_b2b_R1_P0_G3.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 98830, "response_id": "3a276c3a-1d3d-41bb-b46b-de1eaa3ccaac", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 214, "completion_tokens": 5986, "total_tokens": 6200, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 5630}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 86}}
